WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.110
A town is growing fast.

2
00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:05.110
To make room, it cuts down
the trees on a hillside,

3
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.750
and covers the slope in
roads and car parks.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.910
Then, one night, heavy rain falls.

5
00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.790
Where does all that water go?

6
00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:17.450
Has the town made a flood
more likely, or less likely?

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.090
In this mission, you'll see why
people move from villages to

8
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:21.680
cities.

9
00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.990
You'll measure how
developed a country is,

10
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:26.390
using indicators like life expectancy.

11
00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:30.590
You'll sort energy into
renewable and non-renewable.

12
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.670
And you'll see how people and
the planet keep changing each

13
00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:34.630
other.

14
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:38.110
Your mission: predict what
happens on that hillside after the

15
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:38.990
rain.
